        "body": "<!DOCTYPE html\n  SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\" dir=\"ltr\"><head><title>Master Data<\/title><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen,projection\" href=\"/resource/css/style-v2.css\"><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"js/sap-strings.js\"><\/script><\/head><body class=\"en-us sap-light centered navigation-default enumeration-disabled\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-container\" class=\"container_12\" role=\"application\"><div id=\"d4h5-section-container\" class=\"grid_12\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-content\" class=\"grid_8 alpha omega\"><section><div class=\"page topic  - topic-topic \" id=\"loioe369ce53118d4308e10000000a174cb4\"><h1 class=\"title topictitle1\">Master Data<\/h1><div class=\"body\"><p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">Purpose<\/span><\/p> <p class=\"p\">This component contains data for the <span class=\"ph uicontrol\">Utilities Industry<\/span> (IS-U) component that remains unchanged over a long period of time.<\/p> <p class=\"p\">There are two different types of master data:<\/p> <div class=\"fig fignone\" id=\"id-15235-loioe369ce53118d4308e10000000a174cb4--fig-56-32-0\"><div class=\"figbody\"><img class=\"inline\" id=\"loioe369ce53118d4308e10000000a174cb4__image_qr3_ywh_xkb\" src=\"loio21577691703a4745a8bcfa5dace7f885_LowRes.png\"><\/div><\/div> <p class=\"p\">Business master data includes:<\/p> <ul class=\"ul\"><li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Business partner<\/p><\/li><li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Contract account<\/p><\/li><li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Contract (billable service)<\/p><\/li><li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Service provider<\/p><\/li><li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Non-billable service<\/p><\/li><\/ul> <p class=\"p\">Technical master data includes:<\/p> <ul class=\"ul\"><li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Grid<\/p><\/li><li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Point of delivery<\/p><\/li><li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Connection<\/p><\/li><li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Connection object<\/p><\/li><li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Technical installation<\/p><\/li><li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Premise<\/p><\/li><li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Device location<\/p><\/li><li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Installation<\/p><\/li><li class=\"li\"><p class=\"p\">Device<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/div><\/div><\/section><div class=\"clear\"><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/body><\/html>",
